		<p data-i18n="catalog.subheading" class="mt-4 text-center font-helvetica text-base font-normal text-neutral-900 sm:text-lg dark:text-white">
			Droparabia sources you the best selling products in Lebanon so you don't need to buy bulk inventories from
			China and pay shipping fees or search for hours looking for a product to sell
		</p>
	</div>
	<div id="niche-toggle" class="pointer-events-auto relative flex items-center gap-3 rtl:flex-row-reverse sm:gap-4 lg:gap-6">
		<button
